@startuml
' 第六週（claude 版本）：重構後只看類別與關係（投影片用）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide members

class MissionLog
class Mission
class Rover
class MissionStep

MissionLog ..> Mission : new, run()
MissionLog ..> Rover : new, getXxx()
MissionLog ..> MissionStep : describe()
Mission --> "1" Rover : rover
Mission "1" *-- "0..*" MissionStep : steps
@enduml
